{"product_id":"drop-sauna","title":"Drop Sauna","description":"\u003cp\u003eA Drop sauna is a perfect addition to both summer cottages and\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ehome patios, just like other iconic Drop products. This turnkey out-\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003edoor sauna is ready to transform your space effortlessly. All it takes\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eis an electrician and a flat spot to set it up. You can choose either a\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003econvenient electric heater or a wood-burning stove for your ultimate\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003erelaxation.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade of CLT (Cross-Laminated Timber)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExterior walls treated with black\/clear wood stain or covered with light paint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSauna walls and benches feature neutral sauna wax, while the floor is treated with floor oil. Window wall is tinted to match the exterior walls\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDoor made of CLT, a lock, a long black handle and a roller latch\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eRoof covered with black bitumen and black edge plates\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElectrically heated Huum Cliff 9kW heater or wood-burning Juup Iiivari artisan stove\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIndirect lighting embedded along the back wall and ceiling with led-stripes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSubfloor with slope towards a floor gap, serving as a floor drain\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNatural ventilation with inlet and exhaust\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSpacious benches, accommodating up to five sauna-goers\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWeight approximately 2000 kg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions 230 x 230 x 230 cm (+ 10 cm base)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGuarantees: structural CLT 10 years, Electric Huum Cliff heater 5 years, Wooden Juup Iivari stove 10 years\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e• Design: drawings for the sauna: floor, facade, sectional drawings, CLT element design, electrical design and production design.\u003cbr\u003e• Exterior walls: CLT 100mm SURFACE CLT 100mm\u003cbr\u003e• CLT 100mm, 2 parts + subfloor treated spruce 48X98\u003cbr\u003e• Boards: CLT 100mm\u003cbr\u003e• Front window frame: CLT 100mm machined with teardrop shaped opening according to drawings. Façades: colourless moulding as primer, surface treatment with tinted ballast. Colours: black, colourless and opaque white.\u003cbr\u003e• Roof: black bituminous roofing (base and top felt), black edging tiles.\u003cbr\u003e• Exterior door: fluted wooden door CLT 60mm Hide hinge TE 340 3D F1 2pcs Exterior door locking: lock frame Abloy LC102 + iron + key slot Abloy Easy CY001J black Exterior door puller oak handle Pillow 20233\u003cbr\u003e• Window: insulating glass element 2k tempered.\u003cbr\u003e• Finish: floors: CLT treated with Tikkurila Supi floor oil\u003cbr\u003e• Surface treatment: walls, ceilings and ceilings: CLT treated with Tikkurila Supi sauna wax (10% whitewash)\u003cbr\u003e• Heater: Huum Cliff 9kw + stones 5-10cm + control centre UKU local Glass\u003cbr\u003e• Ventilation. Supply air through a floor recess, exhaust air through a hatch in the wall.\u003cbr\u003e• Water control: pouring the CLT subfloor slab into a gap in the floor.\u003cbr\u003e• Electricity: group control panel, power supply and connection to heater and lighting. Includes switch 1-piece ABB impressivo black and the necessary transformer. Power plug 3x16A. PLEASE NOTE! Electrical installation in accordance with Finnish regulations and electricity network. Separately on request, instructions for converting the system to 1-phase.\u003cbr\u003e• Lighting: LED strip on the ceiling, on the back wall: Superled PRO TUNNELMA LED strip 4.3W\/m, 24V, IP65 Superled Dimmable LED transformer NAPA, 12V\/24V, 5-30W Superled LED profile with cover, 16x7mm, silver\u003cbr\u003e• Accessories: fixing accessories, sealing compounds and sealing tapes\u003cbr\u003e• Packaging: corner protectors and shrink-wrap (white)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","brand":"Drop","offers":[{"title":"White \/ Electric \/ Standard","offer_id":48623845245252,"sku":"","price":28000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Electric \/ Carittii Sauna LED light","offer_id":48623845278020,"sku":"","price":29000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Wooden \/ Standard","offer_id":48623845310788,"sku":"","price":28000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"White \/ Wooden \/ Carittii Sauna LED light","offer_id":48623845376324,"sku":"","price":29000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Electric \/ Standard","offer_id":48623845409092,"sku":"","price":28000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Electric \/ Carittii Sauna LED light","offer_id":48623845441860,"sku":"","price":29000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Wooden \/ Standard","offer_id":48623845474628,"sku":"","price":28000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black \/ Wooden \/ Carittii Sauna LED light","offer_id":48623845507396,"sku":"","price":29000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Natural \/ Electric \/ Standard","offer_id":48623845540164,"sku":"","price":28000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Natural \/ Electric \/ Carittii Sauna LED light","offer_id":48623845572932,"sku":"","price":29000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Natural \/ Wooden \/ Standard","offer_id":48623845605700,"sku":"","price":28000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"Natural \/ Wooden \/ Carittii Sauna LED light","offer_id":48623845638468,"sku":"","price":29000.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0556\/0857\/4276\/files\/Packshot_white_sauna_handle_front_1.png?v=1717499517","url":"https:\/\/heatica.com\/products\/drop-sauna","provider":"Heatica","version":"1.0","type":"link"}